        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2252] If the CSO uses WPA3-Enterprise, its AP shall not support WPA3-Enterprise transition mode. Refer to WPA3 specifications for details.",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                167,
                1052,
                223
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    69.0,
                    167.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    167.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    223.0
                ],
                [
                    69.0,
                    223.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2253] Regardless of WPA3-Enterprise is used or WPA2-Enterprise is used, the EV's WLAN STA (see ISO 15118-8 for details) shall implement MAC address randomization. Refer to WPA3 specifications for details.",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                242,
                1052,
                322
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    69.0,
                    242.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    242.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    322.0
                ],
                [
                    69.0,
                    322.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2254] Regardless of WPA3-Enterprise is used or WPA2-Enterprise is used, the EV's WLAN STA (see ISO 15118-8 for details) shall implement \"server certificate validation\" to ensure that the AP that the EVCC connects to is a valid and trustworthy WLAN AP.",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                344,
                1053,
                423
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    69.0,
                    344.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    344.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    423.0
                ],
                [
                    69.0,
                    423.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2256] The EVCC shall disable user override of server certificate (UOSC). Refer to WPA3 specifications for further details.",
            "block_bbox": [
                70,
                445,
                1053,
                499
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    70.0,
                    445.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    445.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    499.0
                ],
                [
                    70.0,
                    499.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 2 This means TOD-STRICT (trust override disable strict) applies. This requirement applies to both WPA3-Enterprise and WPA2-Enterprise.",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                520,
                1052,
                570
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    69.0,
                    520.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    520.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    570.0
                ],
                [
                    69.0,
                    570.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2255] The CSO shall provide an SECC certificate, as defined in Annex B, to the EVCC so that the EVCC can authenticate the CSO's authentication server.",
            "block_bbox": [
                70,
                592,
                1053,
                647
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    70.0,
                    592.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    592.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    647.0
                ],
                [
                    70.0,
                    647.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2257] The EVCC shall authenticate CSO's authentication server with the certificate provided by the CSO's authentication server.",
            "block_bbox": [
                71,
                667,
                1052,
                722
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    71.0,
                    667.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    667.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    722.0
                ],
                [
                    71.0,
                    722.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2258] The EVCC shall validate the provided certificate per [V2G20-1001] (with the SECC certificate profile as defined in Annex B).",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                743,
                1053,
                799
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 8,
