        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2263] If the CSO’s authentication server is unable to successfully authenticate the EV, it shall decline establishing a wireless connection with the EV. The CSO’s access point forwards the data traffic to the SECC only after CSO’s authentication server indicates successful mutual authentication via IEEE 802.1X.",
